/E (The FDP session was inaugurated by Dr. K. Bala Sindhuri, who welcomed the participants and introduced the resource person, Naga Subrahmanyam Tirumala, Digital Design Engineer, Texas Instruments, Bengaluru. The online session was attended by 60 faculty members.The expert delivered a talk on "Low Power VLSI Design for IoT: Power Domain and Clock Domain Crossing," highlighting low-power design techniques, power domain management, and clock domain crossing for reliable and efficient VLSI systems. The session offered valuable industry-oriented insights into modern VLSI design. The programme concluded with remarks by Dr. K. Bala Sindhuri, followed by a vote of thanks by Dr. M. Satish Kumar.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [6]
>>
