/E (The FDP session was inaugurated by Dr. K. Bala Sindhuri, who welcomed the participants and introduced the resource person, Dr. Sangeeta Singh, Assistant Professor, Vardhaman College of Engineering, Hyderabad. The online session was attended by 60 faculty members.The expert delivered a talk on "Hardware Security in VLSI Circuits," covering IoT security, classifications of Physical Unclonable Functions \(PUFs\), and system-level security threats. The session provided valuable insights into modern hardware security techniques and challenges in developing secure VLSI systems. The programme concluded with remarks by Dr. K. Bala Sindhuri, followed by a vote of thanks by Mr. T. V. Syamala Raju.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [8]
>>
