/P 95 0 R
/T (The programme witnessed enthusiastic participation from 80 students and 25 faculty members from various departments, making it a valuable multidisciplinary learning experience. Students actively interacted with the resource person through discussions and a question-and-answer session, gaining practical knowledge about start-up ecosystems, product innovation, prototype commercialization, and emerging technologies. They were also encouraged to utilize institutional innovation platforms and participate in prototype exhibitions, hackathons, start-up challenges, and incubation programmes. The event was coordinated by Dr. J. Ravi, Department of Electronics and Communication Engineering, under the convenorship of Dr. S. S. Mohan Reddy, Head, ECE. The session successfully enhanced awareness of innovation-driven entrepreneurship, prototype development, and scalable business models, while encouraging participants to explore entrepreneurship as a promising career path. Overall, the expert talk served as an inspiring platform for promoting innovation, interdisciplinary collaboration, and entrepreneurial excellence, motivating students and faculty to transform creative ideas into impactful technological solutions.)
/E (The programme witnessed enthusiastic participation from 80 students and 25 faculty members from various departments, making it a valuable multidisciplinary learning experience. Students actively interacted with the resource person through discussions and a question-and-answer session, gaining practical knowledge about start-up ecosystems, product innovation, prototype commercialization, and emerging technologies. They were also encouraged to utilize institutional innovation platforms and participate in prototype exhibitions, hackathons, start-up challenges, and incubation programmes. The event was coordinated by Dr. J. Ravi, Department of Electronics and Communication Engineering, under the convenorship of Dr. S. S. Mohan Reddy, Head, ECE. The session successfully enhanced awareness of innovation-driven entrepreneurship, prototype development, and scalable business models, while encouraging participants to explore entrepreneurship as a promising career path. Overall, the expert talk served as an inspiring platform for promoting innovation, interdisciplinary collaboration, and entrepreneurial excellence, motivating students and faculty to transform creative ideas into impactful technological solutions.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [4]
