864 0 obj
<<
/Title (The Department of Electronics and Communication Engineering congratulates B. Tapasvi, Assistant Professor, on successfully completing the AICTE Quality Improvement Programme \(QIP\) Postgraduate Certification Programme in Deep Learning: Fundamentals and Applications conducted by Sardar Vallabhbhai National Institute of Technology \(SVNIT\), Surat, Gujarat, from 16 June 2025 to 23 December 2025. The six-month programme was attended by 47 faculty members from across the country and covered key topics including Essential Mathematics for Deep Learning, Python Programming, Machine Learning, Neural Networks, Deep Learning Architectures, and a Mini Project.The programme was coordinated by Dr. Kamal Captain, with sessions delivered by Dr. Kamal Captain, Dr. Kishore Upla, Dr. Suman Deb, and Prof. J. N. Sarvaiya.It was designed to provide faculty members with a strong foundation in deep learning and practical exposure to AI technologies for teaching and research. The successful completion of this certification reflects Ms. Tapasvi's commitment to continuous learning, professional development, and excellence in emerging technologies.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 860 0 R
/Next 865 0 R
>>
endobj
