872 0 obj
<<
/Title (On January 23, 2026, the ECE Department, in association with the SRKREC Alumni Association, hosted an enriching guest lecture on "Life Skills, Global Opportunities, and Moral Values." The session was led by distinguished alumnus Mr. Chandra Sekhar Nallam, Founder and CEO of eNcloud Services LLC. Graced by HOD Dr. S. S. Mohan Reddy and retired professors Dr. K. V. S. N. Raju and Dr. D. V. R. Mohan, the event offered students invaluable insights into holistic personal and professional development. Mr. Nallam drew from his global corporate journey to guide students on higher education prospects abroad, diverse career domains, and industry expectations, while emphasizing core values like integrity, leadership, and adaptability. The highly interactive session concluded with a special felicitation of the guest speaker, leaving ECE students inspired to build strong technical skills grounded in ethical values.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 866 0 R
/Next 873 0 R
>>
endobj
